// CARTRIDGE LABEL ART — one code-drawn inline SVG per game, keyed by id.
// Redrawn from look D's twelve cartridge labels in the Specimen material: the
// same compositions printed in ink on oat (currentColor, a few tints of it and
// the cell's own ground), 1px hairlines that hold at any size, no hue. The
// selected cell fills ink, so its label prints in reverse with no extra rule.
// The name band under each old label is gone because the cell sets the name in
// type. Labels are code-drawn as a shelf convention (in-game art is code-drawn or
// licensed + credited, per the field-trials README). Decorative: the button
// already carries the game's name.
